; Late routes - adventurous, B minor turning to D major. Original composition, CC0-1.0.
#title Toward the Summit
#tempo 150
#time 4/4
#key B minor
#inst 1 duty=2 env=12,-5 rel=-2 vib=16,14,6
#inst 2 duty=0 env=6,-1
#inst 3 wave=6 env=12,0
#def R o4 l16 [c e g > c <]4 l8
#def r o4 l16 [c d+ g > c <]4 l8
#def R2 o4 l16 [c e g > c <]2 l8
#def r2 o4 l16 [c d+ g > c <]2 l8
#def ob o2 [c8 > c8 <]4
#def ob2 o2 [c8 > c8 <]2
#def bt K8 H8 S8 H8 K8 K8 S8 H8
#def fl K8 H8 S8 H8 S16 S16 S16 S16 M8 T8
#def ma o5 f+4. b8 r8 b8 a8 f+8 | o5 g4. d8 r8 g8 a8 b8 | o5 a4. f+8 d4 a4 | o5 e2 c+4 e4 | o5 f+4. b8 r8 b8 o6 c+8 d8 | o6 d4. o5 b8 g4 b4 | o5 g4 e4 f+4 a+4 | o5 b2. r4 |
#def mb o5 d8 g8 b8 o6 d8 o5 b4 g4 | o5 c+8 e8 a8 o6 c+8 o5 a4 e4 | o5 f+4. e8 f+8 a8 c+8 f+8 | o5 d2 b4 o6 d4 | o5 d8 g8 b8 o6 d8 e4 d4 | o6 c+4. o5 b8 a4 e4 | o5 f+4 a+4 o6 c+4 o5 a+4 | o5 f+2. r4 |
#def ha k-1{r} | k-5{R} | k2{R} | k-3{R} | k-1{r} | k-5{R} | k4{r2} k-6{R2} | k-1{r} | k0
#def hb k-5{R} | k-3{R} | k-6{r} | k-1{r} | k-5{R} | k-3{R} | k-6{R} | k-6{R} | k0
#def ba k11{ob} | k7{ob} | k2{ob} | k9{ob} | k11{ob} | k7{ob} | k4{ob2} k6{ob2} | k11{ob} | k0
#def bb k7{ob} | k9{ob} | k6{ob} | k11{ob} | k7{ob} | k9{ob} | k6{ob} | k6{ob} | k0

A @1 $ {ma} {mb} {ma}
B @2 $ {ha} {hb} {ha}
C @3 $ {ba} {bb} {ba}
D v11 $ [[{bt}]7 {fl}]3
